# The platform portal is deliberately NOT tracked here. Its
# assets/js/config.js ships a live COAir username and password in plain text
# (its own README says so), so committing it as-is would put working
# credentials in the history. Strip them — set signIn:'none' and drop the
# credentials block — before deciding to version it.
delay-disputes-portal/

# Stray screenshots from local UI runs.
/*.png

# The six authored chronologies live in content/chronologies/ under stable
# numbered names. This folder is the same six files under their original titles
# (md5-identical) — a handover copy, not a second source of truth.
Sample Chronologies/
